        "original_id": "785babed-e9df-5d50-a2e8-463a33823ea7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Be Right There\", \"The Warrior's Gate\", Enter The Warrior's Gate\n- People: Diplo, Sleepy Tom, Priscilla Renea, Luc Besson, Robert Mark Kamen\n- Topics: song credits, film release\n\nFacts:\n- \"Be Right There\" is a song recorded by Diplo and Sleepy Tom and features uncredited vocals from Priscilla Renea.\n- \"The Warrior's Gate\", also released as Enter The Warrior's Gate, is a 2016 Chinese-French action-adventure-fantasy film directed and written by Luc Besson and Robert Mark Kamen.\n- \"The Warrior's Gate\" was released in China on November 18, 2016, in 2D, 3D, and China Film Giant Screen 3D.\n- \"The Warrior's Gate\" was released on VOD in the United States on May 5.\n- The song \"Be Right There\" was featured in the film \"The Warrior's Gate\".",
